{"kind":"assert","text":"Planner decision: the authority, effects and publication note, revision 26 at f7175296cd0750df6629b72fc5cd073ed2ec6bff, is adopted on builder's request 693ce95a (approved e490a5c6, reported e1569860). It replaces revision 24 (d5616522) as the note in force; revision 25 was never adopted. It restores the controller-of-agent clause of the single-controller exception and carries the planner's four answers of 5a036318: the exception takes effect when the sole controller is an author or controls an agent among the authors; an outside link is never met; a path name that is not text is not met with rules named; a repository has the first definition's three extents before its first publish. It decides the directory, register, destination and extents rows that blocked founding and publication. Builder ratifies the report as originator. Open asks of the contract and other owners stay with them."}